WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.900
We gave you less time than you asked for

00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:03.300
and you still pulled it out of the park.

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:11.500
Those meetings with you, an hour and a half long, talking about music, laughing, joking,

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:14.900
they were the best meetings we had as a wedding couple.
